  "zero_work_assertions": [
    "invalid Host does not call client registration",
    "disabled DCR creates no client",
    "rate rejection creates no excess client",
    "missing, incapable, non-shared, failed, and malformed stores create no client",
    "DCR duplicate names, wrong media type, oversized bodies, and a failed rate store halt before Action Controller instrumentation",
    "accepted DCR JSON is parsed exactly once and reused by Rails",
    "invalid Host is rejected before a Rack body stream is read",
    "accepted form and JSON requests read a Rack-compliant non-rewindable stream once and replay only the bounded cached bytes",
    "allowed-origin admission failures retain exact CORS and Vary headers while denied origins receive none",
    "token and revocation instrumentation contains no code, code_verifier, or token body parameter",
    "oversized authorize, token, and revoke forms halt before controller instrumentation",
    "malformed PKCE challenges persist no code and malformed verifiers do no code lookup",
    "short-reading Rack inputs cannot hide duplicate form parameters or body overflow",
    "Rails-normalized OAuth path variants retain the same pre-parser cap while host-owned shadow routes retain ordinary form bodies",
    "successful authorization-code redirects bypass Rails redirect instrumentation and carry no-store/no-cache"
